  "scope": "RC36 retains the merged RC35 source. Eight ordered manual CAD tasks and one movable task window. No guided-mode tab strip or wide stage navigation. Scene drawer starts collapsed; camera/analysis/settings menus open on demand. Only one inspector section opens at a time. Detail parameters start closed and connector settings appear only when selected. Existing projects and recovery drafts resume their saved task. Context menu, keyboard, tool catalog and parameters share the task policy. Expert mode requires explicit selection. The unchanged palette, all bundled translations, RC33 dental scan assets and restored AYA core remain included. The geometry kernel is unchanged; no clinical or regulatory approval is claimed."
